{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1489201-tc-major-npcs-stats-across-eras","id":1489201,"title":"TC Major NPCs stats across eras","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-05T01:19:10-07:00","id":1489201,"title":"TC Major NPCs stats across eras","content":"I run multi era <b>Trinity</b> game, about Aeon Society, Max Mercer, Michael Donighal / Doctor Primoris / Divis Mal, etc. Those figures will show up in my game, as major NPCs in them. As I see various era text, they do not have official stats. If they exists in some books, please point me. Other than that, in this topic we will create stats fir those NPCs in <b>Trinity</b> 2E.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-05T04:17:46-07:00","id":1489214,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Max Mercer ( 1923, half year after Hammersmith Incident / at start of Aeon Society )</span></b><br /> <br /> Max just returned to the 'present' timeline of 1923, after jumping 200 years in the future - to year circa 2123, i.e. Aeon Era. He is Daredevil, instinctively using his few Gifts. For now, he is just more or less semi-famous explorer and adventurer.<br /> <br /> <b>Max Mercer in year 1923<br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\">( Veteran level after Hammersmith )</span></b><br /> <br /> <b>Concept:</b> Businessman, entrepreneur, explorer, and physicist \u2013 Creator of modern Aeon Society<br /> <b>Origin Path: </b><i>Field Researcher</i><br /> <b>Role Path: </b><i>Show Off</i><br /> <b>Society Path: </b><i>Esoteric Order of Aeons</i><br /> <b>Moment of Inspiration: </b><i>Exposure To Flux ( Hammersmith Incident 1922 )</i><br /> <b>Skills: </b>Athletics 3, Close Combat 3, Command 1, Culture 2, Enigmas 2, Humanities 2, Persuasion 1, Pilot 1, Science 4, Survival 1, Technology 1<br /> <b>Attributes</b><br /> Intellect 3 Cunning 2 Resolve 2<br /> Might 3 Dexterity 3 Stamina 3<br /> Presence 4 Manipulation 3 Composure 3<br /> <b>Inspiration: </b>3<br /> <b>Defense: </b>3 ( Start <b>1 + 2 </b>from <b>Chronal Awareness</b>, <b>Defense 2 + 2 </b>with Static Defence House Rule )<br /> <b>Armor: </b>0 (? On graphics he do not seem to wear any kind armor )<br /> <b>Health (6) </b>\u2013 Got +1 Injured level from Stamina 3<br /> \ud83d\udd32Bruised<br /> \ud83d\udd32Bruised<br /> \ud83d\udd32Injured<br /> \ud83d\udd32Injured<br /> \ud83d\udd32Injured<br /> \ud83d\udd32Maimed<br /> Taken Out<br /> <br /> <b>Edges: </b>Adrenaline Spike 2, Direction Sense 1, Fame 1, Hardy 1, Hair Trigger Reflexes 1, Polyglot 1 ( Adventure! or Aether ), Outsized Personality 1 ( Adventure! ), Striking 2, Useful Esoterica, Wealth 5<br /> <b>Facets</b><br /> Destructive ( Intention )<br /> Intuitive ( Luck ) 2<br /> Reflective ( Skill ) 1<br /> <br /> <b>Gifts</b><br /> <b>Lucky Son of a Gun ( Adventure! )</b><br /> <b>Nick of Time ( Adventure! )</b><br /> Special - <b>Chronal Awareness</b> (<i>Timelines Mastery</i>, Luck ) - Special power of Max as Daredevils / Talents \u2018Proxy\u2019 \u2013 His time manipulation ability. Roughly Time 5 Arcana / Sphere from <b>Mage</b> RPGs.<br /> / Just after Hammersmith it can works more like Time 2, for start of his training. /<br /> <br /> Sum up of Time Arcana from <b>MtAw</b> 1E from <a href=\"https://www.scribd.com/doc/38709385/Mage-the-Awakening-Creative-Thaumaturgy\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Creative Thaumaturgy</b> fan document</a><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b> Time \u2022 (Initiate)</b><br /> \u2022 <b>Compelling </b>(Nothing listed in the book)<br /> - Let a small event occur at just the right (or wrong) time, e.g. ensure that a falling plant pot just misses a person walking below, or that a person happens to bump into his future soulmate at a street corner at just the right time - or that a payphone call at a bus stop ends just as the bus heaves into view?<br /> \u2022 <b>Knowing</b><br /> - Scrutinise an ongoing event and determine whether it will bene\ufb01t or hinder caster in future.<br /> - Sense the perfect moment to perform one mundane action (bonus to the next Skill roll made).<br /> \u2022 <b>Unveiling</b><br /> - Mage Sight (Temporal Eddies). Sense magic. Scrutinise magic. Sense resonance by the way it a\ufb00ects the timestream. - Sense perfect time, anywhere. - Sense temporal disturbances (e.g. use of Time Arcanum, people su\ufb00ering from \u201clost\u201d time etc).<br /> <b>Time \u2022\u2022 (Apprentice)</b><br /> \u2022\u2022 <b>Ruling </b>(no speci\ufb01c examples given in the book)<br /> - Temporal Sympathy: mage can use sympathetic links between objects separated by time.<br /> \u2022\u2022 <b>Shielding</b><br /> - Protect oneself from physical harm with slight Time warps and eddies. ( <i><u>Time dots as bonus to Defense </u></i>)<br /> <b>\u2022\u2022 Unveiling</b><br /> - See the future in general terms (simple answers).<br /> - Postcognition: Perceive an event in the past with clarity. Concentration.<br /> \u2022\u2022 Knowing<br /> - Scry ahead in time to check the result of an ongoing event with a simple outcome (coin toss, dice throw, red wire or green wire etc).<br /> - Scry the outcome of a current personal action, and reroll it if necessary.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>How do we made it - details below in topic posts...</b></span><br /> <br /> Let's make it by the <b>Adventure! </b>( and others ) books<br /> <br /> <b>Step One: Concept</b> \u2705<br /> <i>Choose your character\u2019s name, background, and Aspirations. </i><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> This can we pass, as we know who Max Mercer is. \ud83d\ude0e </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Step Two: Paths </b>\u2705<br /> <i>Choose your character\u2019s Origin, Role, and Society Paths.</i><i>Gain Skill dots and Edge dots from each Path. </i><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Here we need to use some information\u2019s and options from <b>Aether </b>Kickstarter preview, to determine past of the Max. From <b>Aether </b>book we know that Max parents, Richard and Anne Mercers, were field researchers for <b><i>Esoteric Order of Aeons</i></b>, \u2018secret\u2019 society of Victorian scientific investigators into wonders and horrors of Aether energy ( what later be known as Flux or mix of Telluric Energies, evidence are not conclusive ). This implies that Origin for Max is <b><i>Field Researcher </i></b>from <b>Adventure! </b>\u2013 he is literal poster boy of this particular Origin. I think about Role for him as <b><i>Show Off</i></b> \u2013 he seems to this kind of guy, from all the lore I read about him to this day. For now he is part of <b><i>Esoteric Order of Aeons</i></b> that he will reform in to \u2018modern\u2019 <b><i>Aeon Society</i></b>, aimed more on utopian and humanitarian work in coming years.<br /> <br /> <b>Max Paths</b><br /> <br /> Origin - <b><i>Field Researcher </i></b>( from <b>Adventure!</b> book )<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <b>Example Connections:</b> Academics, Foreign Friends, Grad Students, Librarians, Travel Guides<br /> <b>Skills: </b>Culture, Eni