this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <b>Extra Skill dots - </b>Athletics 1, Close Combat 1, Humanities 2, Pilot 1, Science 1<br /> <br /> <b>Max starting Skills final spread</b> \u2013 Athletics 1, Close Combat 1, Command 1, Culture 2, Enigmas 2, Humanities 2, Persuasion 1, Pilot 1, Survival 1, Science 2, Technology 1<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <b>Step Four: Attributes </b>\u2705<br /> <i>Assign your Attribute dots and select your character\u2019s favored approach.</i><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> First we choose priority on Mental, Physical and Social Arenas. Describing him as <i>&quot;multi-millionaire philanthropist - businessman, entrepreneur, explorer, and physicist&quot;</i> seems to point him as Social first, Physical second and Mental third character. It means Social 6 dots, Physical 4 and Mental 2 \u2013 at least on start. Starting with 1 dot in each Attribute, I would see dots first spread as this:<br /> <br /> Presence 3 Manipulation 3 Composure 3<br /> Might 2 Dexterity 2 Stamina 3<br /> Intellect 2 Cunning 1 Resolve 2<br /> <br /> Bombastic and outgoing Max seems to me he should be at Forceful Approach. This means\u2026.<br /> <br /> <b>Final Max starting Attributes spread</b>:<br /> Presence 4 Manipulation 3 Composure 3<br /> Might 3 Dexterity 2 Stamina 3<br /> Intellect 3 Cunning 1 Resolve 2<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <b>Step Five: Moment of Inspiration </b>\u2705<br /> <i>Decide how the moment of Inspiration occurred, and whether the character became a daredevil, stalwart, or mesmerist.</i><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <b><i>Hammersmith Incident </i></b> in 1922 is <i>Moment of Inspiration</i> for Max, setting him as (super)Daredevil. It works perfectly with <b>Exposure To Flux </b>option from corebook, so we chose +1 dot to any Physical Attribute. Max felt to me more \u2018slick\u2019 than mighty character \u2013 so we go with +1 for Dexterity.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Trinity Core 2E Rulebook</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>EXPOSURE TO FLUX </b><br /> The character was exposed to a high level of flux. The character may have been born in the middle of a flux storm, his infant body absorbing the swirling energies in the air. The character might be exposed to flux later in life during a presentation of some advanced technology, or during some kind of archeological survey.<br /> <b>Associated Attribute:</b> Any Physical</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Max Attributes after Moment of Inspiration</b>:<br /> Presence 4 Manipulation 3 Composure 3<br /> Might 3 Dexterity 3 Stamina 3<br /> Intellect 3 Cunning 1 Resolve 2<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <b>Step Six: Add Advantages </b><br /> <i>Assign three points between the Facets. Calculate your Inspiration pool. Gain four Gifts.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Step Seven: Final Touches </b><br /> <i>Calculate Health and Defense ratings, as detailed on p.38 of the <b>Trinity Continuum Core</b>. Assign one bonus dot to any Attribute, and spend four dots of Edges </i><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> <b>Max Attributes after Bonus Dot ( got Cunning +1 )</b><br /> Presence 4 Manipulation 3 Composure 3<br /> Might 3 Dexterity 3 Stamina 3<br /> Intellect 3 Cunning 2 Resolve 2<br /> <br /> <b>Max secondary stats</b><br /> <b>Health </b>\u2013 Got +1 Injured level from Stamina 3<br /> <b>Defense 1</b> ( <b>Defense 2 </b>with Static Defence House Rule ) </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Step Eight: Advancement to Veteran (50XP)</b>\u2705<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Here are my 50XP investments options for Max:<ul><li>10 XP - <b>Skills:</b> <i>Athletics</i> +2 ( to 3 dots )</li> <li>10 XP - <b>Skills:</b> <i>Science</i> +2 ( to 4 dots ) \u2013 Literal time travel 200 years in future makes you great in Physics. \ud83d\ude0e</li> <li>10 XP - <b>Skills:</b> <i>Close Combat</i> +2 ( to 3 dots ) \u2013 Max is shown on covers and illustration with punching bad guys, a lot. \ud83d\ude09</li> <li>3 XP - <b>Edge:</b> <i>Wealth</i> +1 ( to 5 dots ) \u2013 Time travel let\u2019s you invest in better future profits \ud83d\ude0e</li> <li>2 XP - <b>Edge:</b> <i>Hardy </i>1 dot \u2013 Max is world known explorer, even in jungle on <b>Adventure!</b> book cover</li> <li>2 XP - <b>Edge:</b> <i>Hair Trigger Reflexes</i> 1 dot</li> <li>2 XP - <b>Edge:</b> <i>Striking</i> 2 dot</li> <li>3 XP - <b>Edge:</b> <i>Useful Esoterica</i> 1 dots \u2013 He travels A LOT.</li> </ul><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 09-08-2022, 06:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-06T14:14:41-07:00","id":1489363,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Max Mercer is described in Adventure! as a &quot;multi-millionaire philanthropist&quot;, so he needs Wealth 5, but wouldn't count as Loaded, since in the '20s that'd mean he's worth at least $100 million.<br /> <br /> He's also described as a, &quot;businessman, entrepreneur, explorer, and physicist.&quot; As an explorer, he should have at least one dot in Survival and possibly Pilot. As a physicist, he should have at least one dot in Science.<br /> <br /> It goes on to state he, &quot;earned a double major in chemistry and philosophy from Harvard, but earned his Master\u2019s degree in sociology.&quot; His knowledge of chemistry in addition to physics should boost Science to two or three dots. His degrees in philosophy and sociology would be worth multiple dots in Humanities.<br /> <br /> The manuscript also says, &quot;Max Mercer, wunderkind physicist Michael Donighal, and Hammersmith\u2019s laboratory assistant, Sara Kaur, were exposed to the most intense and direct dosages of telluric energy released in the explosion. This direct exposure at the source of the telluric engine <b><u>unlocked incredible potential</u></b> in these three, making them the <u><b>most powerful and unusual Inspired</b></u> this age would know. A daredevil, stalwart, and mesmerist, respectively, the abilities of this trio represent the <u><b>theoretical pinnacle of what is</b></u><u><b>possible</b></u> through each of these paths of Inspiration.&quot;<br /> <br /> This tells us he isn't a starting character. He likely came out of the Hammersmith event with more power than any other daredevil would achieve over the course of their adventuring careers.</span></span> He likely started with a very high Inspiration score. I'm pretty sure I also saw an author's post on the forum that the big three (Mercer, Donighal, Kaur) should all be considered effectively unaging, possessed of bonus health levels, and able to heal quickly between scenes to represent how hard it is to actually kill them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-06T15:58:08-07:00","id":1489369,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shepherdboi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1489201-tc-major-npcs-stats-across-eras?p=1489363#post1489363\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This tells us he isn't a starting character. He likely came out of the Hammersmith event with more power than any other daredevil would achieve over the course of their adventuring careers. He likely started with a very high Inspiration score.</div> </div> </div> </div>I do only 'Starting Character Creation' to just better ground character - and understand char gen rules better. \ud83d\ude0e I was going to give him 50 XP extra, that should make him VERY capable explorer. And just giving him like Inspiraton 5, for 'free', after Hammersmith Incident. In the end - Max maybe is 'superDaredevil' - but just after Hammersmith he still do not control fully his powers. Rising his <b><i>Inspiration to 10 </i></b>in next 11 years to the proper <b>Adventure!</b> era 1934 year is totally valid in my point of view. However, just after incident, giving him <i>max Inspiration is a bit too much</i>, even to super NPC in game world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-07T01:30:59-07:00","id":1489401,"title":"","content":"I rebulid slightly starting Skills for Max by <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar25506_1.gif');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25506\" data-vbnamecard=\"25506\">Shepherdboi</a> suggestion - and done Skills, Attributes and Moment of Inspiration choosing. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-07-2022, 11:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-29T00:17:02-07:00","id":1491718,"title":"","content":"First take on Max's powers...<br /> <br /> <b>Max Facets</b><br /> <br /> Destructive ( Intention )<br /> Intuitive ( Luck ) 2<br /> Reflective ( Skill ) 1<br /> <br /> <b>Gifts for Daredevils ( For Max )</b><br /> <br /> <b>Possible ones</b><br /> <b>Lucky Son of a Gun ( Adventure! )</b><br /> <b>Nick of Time ( Adventure! ) </b>\u2013 Sounds a lot like what Max was doing with people just after Hammersmith, saving them from burning building. <b>Special Gift for Max!</b><br /> <br /> <b>Chronal Awareness</b> (<i>Timelines Mastery</i>, Luck ) - Special power of Max as Daredevils / Talents \u2018Proxy\u2019 \u2013 His time manipulation ability ( roughly Time 5 Arcana / Sphere from <b>Mage</b> RPGs \ud83d\ude2e ) / Just after Hammersmith it can works more like Time 2, for start of his training. /<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1491557#post1491557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the original game, Max was given a \u201cChronal Awareness\u201d Knack which is described as a very versatile ability to manipulate time; in effect, he had the equivalent of five dots in the Time Sphere from <b>Mage: the Ascension</b>, or five dots in the Time Arcanum from <b>Mage: the Awakening</b>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sum up of Time Arcana from <b>MtAw</b> 1E from <a href=\"https://www.scribd.com/doc/38709385/Mage-the-Awakening-Creative-Thaumaturgy\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Creative Thaumaturgy</b> fan document</a><br /> <b>Time \u2022 (Initiate)</b><br /> \u2022 <b>Compelling </b>(Nothing listed in the book)<br /> - Let a small event occur at just the right (or wrong) time, e.g. ensure that a falling plant pot just misses a person walking below, or that a person happens to bump into his future soulmate at a street corner at just the right time - or that a payphone call at a bus stop ends just as the bus heaves into view?<br /> \u2022 <b>Knowing</b><br /> - Scrutinise an ongoing event and determine whether it will bene\ufb01t or hinder caster in future.<br /> - Sense the perfect moment to perform one mundane action (bonus to the next Skill roll made).<br /> \u2022 <b>Unveiling</b><br /> - Mage Sight (Temporal Eddies). Sense magic. Scrutinise magic. Sense resonance by the way it a\ufb00ects the timestream. - Sense perfect time, anywhere. - Sense temporal disturbances (e.g. use of Time Arcanum, people su\ufb00ering from \u201clost\u201d time etc).<br /> <b>Time \u2022\u2022 (Apprentice)</b><br /> \u2022\u2022 <b>Ruling </b>(no speci\ufb01c examples given in the book)<br /> - Temporal Sympathy: mage can use sympathetic links between objects separated by time.<br /> \u2022\u2022 <b>Shielding</b><br /> - Protect oneself from physical harm with slight Time warps and eddies. ( <i><u>Time dots as bonus to Defense </u></i>)<br /> <b>\u2022\u2022 Unveiling</b><br /> - See the future in general terms (simple answers).<br /> - Postcognition: Perceive an event in the past with clarity. Concentration.<br /> \u2022\u2022 Knowing<br /> - Scry ahead in time to check the result of an ongoing event with a simple outcome (coin toss, dice throw, red wire or green wire etc).<br /> - Scry the outcome of a current personal action, and reroll it if necessary.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-29-2022, 04:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-29T01:17:20-07:00","id":1491720,"title":"","content":"BTW, first take on powers of Micheal Doninghal / Dr. Primoris / future Davis Mal...<br /> <br /> <b>Micheal Donighal / Dr. Primoris </b>( 1922-1923 )<br /> <br /> <b>Superiority</b> ( Intention ) - Special power of Micheal as Stalwarts / Nova \u2018Proxy\u2019 \u2013 His superhuman abilities \u2013 He get\u2019s his <i>I</i><i>ntention</i> dots as Scale in <i>Might, Stamina</i>, and <i>Intellect</i><br /> <br /> <b>Fire Resistance</b> \u2013 Micheal can absorb fire to his body and see through smoke with ease.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 09-01-2022, 12:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-29T09:22:48-07:00","id":1491773,"title":"","content":"I\u2019d just flat-out make him a nova. He\u2019s basically trailblazing the way for other novas go follow. He has no one to guide him through the process. It probably took decades to begin to gain new powers or raise his Quantum score. Once he got rolling, though...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-29T11:05:38-07:00","id":1491785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1489201-tc-major-npcs-stats-across-eras?p=1489369#post1489369\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I do only 'Starting Character Creation' to just better ground character - and understand char gen rules better. \ud83d\ude0e I was going to give him 50 XP extra, that should make him VERY capable explorer. And just giving him like Inspiraton 5, for 'free', after Hammersmith Incident. In the end - Max maybe is 'superDaredevil' - but just after Hammersmith he still do not control fully his powers. Rising his <b><i>Inspiration to 10 </i></b>in next 11 years to the proper <b>Adventure!</b> era 1934 year is totally valid in my point of view. However, just after incident, giving him <i>max Inspiration is a bit too much</i>, even to super NPC in game world.</div> </div> </div> </div>If these Three soaked up so much Telluric energy to become the paragons of their respective kinds <i>and</i> stop aging, I\u2019d give them a lot more than starting Experience.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-29T12:08:01-07:00","id":1491795,"title":"","content":"I like the idea of Max not being ageless, but, as a time traveler, he went everywhen during his young years, and later gave up on time traveling.<br /> <br /> Ian suggested it as his headcanon in discord, and I think it is a great way to deal with his presence during the entire history. He suggested Max would go to Nova Era, but I would make him go to somewhen during the 60s, like 10-20 years after his son shows up. and from that point live on. He would be pretty old (90-100 years old) when Maggie become the boss with him being around. Sure, he would live far more than the usual person (probably die on his 130), but he would be dead prior the Aberrant War (much like a target for him, so he don't need to live through it).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 08-29-2022, 04:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-29T16:59:21-07:00","id":1491834,"title":"","content":"In fact, I\u2019d give them extra abilities normal members of their splat can\u2019t normally access. Stopping aging is certainly one such benefit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-31T21:33:35-07:00","id":1492070,"title":"","content":"<b>Max Final Touches</b><br /> <br /> <i>Calculate Health and Defense ratings, as detailed on p.38 of the Trinity Continuum Core.<br /> Assign one bonus dot to any Attribute, and spend four dots of Edges \u2014 these Edges can come from outside your character\u2019s Paths, but she must meet any other requirements normally. </i><br /> <br /> <b>Max Attributes after Bonus Dot ( got Cunning +1 )</b><br /> Presence 4 Manipulation 3 Composure 3<br /> Might 3 Dexterity 3 Stamina 3<br /> Intellect 3 Cunning 2 Resolve 2<br /> <br /> <b>Max secondary stats</b><br /> <b>Health </b>\u2013 Got +1 Injured level from Stamina 3<br /> <b>Defense 3</b> ( Start <b>1 + 2 </b>from <b>Chronal Awareness</b>, <b>Defense 2 + 2 </b>with Static Defence House Rule )<br /> <br /> Need only to choose 4 dots of Edges - as it's Max, we take all we can in Wealth! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b>Max Edges sum-up</b><br /> Adrenaline Spike 2, Direction Sense 1, Fame 1, Polyglot 1 ( Adventure! or Aether ), Outsized Personality 1 ( Adventure! ), Wealth 4<br /> <br /> And we go for Veteran Advancement for him! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 09-03-2022, 12:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-02T21:47:02-07:00","id":1492200,"title":"","content":"Let's sum up starting stat's for Max - and review mechanics of it. Also, you can point me what kind of 50 XP Advancement you would give him, just after his Hammersmith Incident disappearance. \ud83d\ude0e<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Max Mercer final stats! \ud83d\ude2e</span><br /> ( Before Veteran advancement after Hammersmith )</b><br /> <br /> <b>Concept:</b> Businessman, entrepreneur, explorer, and physicist \u2013 Creator of modern Aeon Society<br /> <b>Origin Path: </b><i>Field Researcher</i><br /> <b>Role Path: </b><i>Show Off</i><br /> <b>Society Path: </b><i>Esoteric Order of Aeons</i><br /> <b>Moment of Inspiration: </b><i>Exposure To Flux ( Hammersmith Incident 1922 )</i><br /> <br /> <b>Skills: </b>Athletics 1, Close Combat 1, Command 1, Culture 2, Enigmas 2, Humanities 2, Persuasion 1, Pilot 1, Science 2, Survival 1, Technology 1<br /> <br /> <b>Attributes</b><br /> Intellect 3 Cunning 2 Resolve 2<br /> Might 3 Dexterity 3 Stamina 3<br /> Presence 4 Manipulation 3 Composure 3<br /> <br /> <b>Inspiration: </b>3<br /> <b>Defense: </b>3 ( Start <b>1 + 2 </b>from <b>Chronal Awareness</b>, <b>Defense 2 + 2 </b>with Static Defence House Rule )<br /> <b>Armor: </b>0 (? On graphics he do not seem to wear any kind armor )<br /> <br /> <b>Health (6) </b>\u2013 Got +1 Injured level from Stamina 3<br /> \ud83d\udd32Bruised<br /> \ud83d\udd32Bruised<br /> \ud83d\udd32Injured<br /> \ud83d\udd32Injured<br /> \ud83d\udd32Injured<br /> \ud83d\udd32Maimed<br /> Taken Out<br /> <br /> <b>Edges: </b>Adrenaline Spike 2, Direction Sense 1, Fame 1, Polyglot 1 ( Adventure! or Aether ), Outsized Personality 1 ( Adventure! ), Wealth 4<br /> <br /> <b>Facets</b><br /> Destructive ( Intention )<br /> Intuitive ( Luck ) 2<br /> Reflective ( Skill ) 1<br /> <br /> <b>Gifts</b><br /> <b>Lucky Son of a Gun ( Adventure! )</b><br /> <b>Nick of Time ( Adventure! ) </b><br /> Special - <b>Chronal Awareness</b> (<i>Timelines Mastery</i>, Luck ) - Special power of Max as Daredevils / Talents \u2018Proxy\u2019 \u2013 His time manipulation ability. Roughly Time 5 Arcana / Sphere from <b>Mage</b> RPGs.<br /> / Just after Hammersmith it can works more like Time 2, for start of his training. /","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 09-08-2022, 06:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-04T03:53:52-07:00","id":1492285,"title":"","content":"<b>Veteran ( 50XP ) advancement of Mercer</b><br /> <br /> So let\u2019s go for advancement of Mercer, after half year of time travel in 1922\u2026<br /> <br /> So I mark most interests users in topic - <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12219\" data-vbnamecard=\"12219\">Demigod Beast</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24985_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24985\" data-vbnamecard=\"24985\">Mateus Luz</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar25506_1.gif');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25506\" data-vbnamecard=\"25506\">Shepherdboi</a><br /> \u200b<br /> Here are my 50XP investments options for Max:<ul><li>10 XP - <b>Skills:</b> <i>Athletics</i> +2 ( to 3 dots )</li> <li>10 XP - <b>Skills:</b> <i>Science</i> +2 ( to 4 dots ) \u2013 Literal time travel 200 years in future makes you great in Physics. \ud83d\ude0e</li> <li>10 XP - <b>Skills:</b> <i>Close Combat</i> +2 ( to 3 dots ) \u2013 Max is shown on covers and illustration with punching bad guys, a lot. \ud83d\ude09</li> <li>3 XP - <b>Edge:</b> <i>Wealth</i> +1 ( to 5 dots ) \u2013 Time travel let\u2019s you invest in better future profits \ud83d\ude0e</li> <li>2 XP - <b>Edge:</b> <i>Hardy </i>1 dot \u2013 Max is world known explorer, even in jungle on <b>Adventure!</b> book cover</li> <li>2 XP - <b>Edge:</b> <i>Hair Trigger Reflexes</i> 1 dot</li> <li>2 XP - <b>Edge:</b> <i>Striking</i> 2 dot</li> <li>3 XP - <b>Edge:</b> <i>Useful Esoterica</i> 1 dots \u2013 He travels A LOT.</li> </ul>It\u2019s still 6 XP more to spend on his advancement. <b>Any ideas you have for Max to buy more?</b><br /> <br /> By the way, looking over XP spending table \u2013 <b>What is \u2018Enhanced Edge\u2019</b>? <b>\ud83e\udd14</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-08T15:43:34-07:00","id":1492637,"title":"","content":"So we don\u2019t have any comments to my advanced plans \u2013 we make them official. Final version of Max Mercer then\u2026 \ud83d\ude0e<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>Max Mercer final final stats! \ud83d\ude2e ( Veteran level after Hammersmith )</b></span><br /> <br /> <b>Concept:</b> Businessman, entrepreneur, explorer, and physicist \u2013 Creator of modern Aeon Society<br /> <b>Origin Path: </b><i>Field Researcher</i><br /> <b>Role Path: </b><i>Show Off</i><br /> <b>Society Path: </b><i>Esoteric Order of Aeons</i><br /> <b>Moment of Inspiration: </b><i>Exposure To Flux ( Hammersmith Incident 1922 )</i><br /> <b>Skills: </b>Athletics 3, Close Combat 3, Command 1, Culture 2, Enigmas 2, Humanities 2, Persuasion 1, Pilot 1, Science 4, Survival 1, Technology 1<br /> <b>Attributes</b><br /> Intellect 3 Cunning 2 Resolve 2<br /> Might 3 Dexterity 3 Stamina 3<br /> Presence 4 Manipulation 3 Composure 3<br /> <b>Inspiration: </b>3<br /> <b>Defense: </b>3 ( Start <b>1 + 2 </b>from <b>Chronal Awareness</b>, <b>Defense 2 + 2 </b>with Static Defence House Rule )<br /> <b>Armor: </b>0 (? On graphics he do not seem to wear any kind armor )<br /> <b>Health (6) </b>\u2013 Got +1 Injured level from Stamina 3<br /> \ud83d\udd32Bruised<br /> \ud83d\udd32Bruised<br /> \ud83d\udd32Injured<br /> \ud83d\udd32Injured<br /> \ud83d\udd32Injured<br /> \ud83d\udd32Maimed<br /> Taken Out<br /> <br /> <b>Edges: </b>Adrenaline Spike 2, Direction Sense 1, Fame 1, Hardy 1, Hair Trigger Reflexes 1, Polyglot 1 ( Adventure! or Aether ), Outsized Personality 1 ( Adventure! ), Striking 2, Useful Esoterica, Wealth 5<br /> <b>Facets</b><br /> Destructive ( Intention )<br /> Intuitive ( Luck ) 2<br /> Reflective ( Skill ) 1<br /> <br /> <b>Gifts</b><br /> <b>Lucky Son of a Gun ( Adventure! )</b><br /> <b>Nick of Time ( Adventure! )</b><br /> Special - <b>Chronal Awareness</b> (<i>Timelines Mastery</i>, Luck ) - Special power of Max as Daredevils / Talents \u2018Proxy\u2019 \u2013 His time manipulation ability. Roughly Time 5 Arcana / Sphere from <b>Mage</b> RPGs.<br /> / Just after Hammersmith it can works more like Time 2, for start of his training. /<br /> <br /> Sum up of Time Arcana from <b>MtAw</b> 1E from <a href=\"https://www.scribd.com/doc/38709385/Mage-the-Awakening-Creative-Thaumaturgy\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Creative Thaumaturgy</b> fan document</a><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b> Time \u2022 (Initiate)</b><br /> \u2022 <b>Compelling </b>(Nothing listed in the book)<br /> - Let a small event occur at just the right (or wrong) time, e.g. ensure that a falling plant pot just misses a person walking below, or that a person happens to bump into his future soulmate at a street corner at just the right time - or that a payphone call at a bus stop ends just as the bus heaves into view?<br /> \u2022 <b>Knowing</b><br /> - Scrutinise an ongoing event and determine whether it will bene\ufb01t or hinder caster in future.<br /> - Sense the perfect moment to perform one mundane action (bonus to the next Skill roll made).<br /> \u2022 <b>Unveiling</b><br /> - Mage Sight (Temporal Eddies). Sense magic. Scrutinise magic. Sense resonance by the way it a\ufb00ects the timestream. - Sense perfect time, anywhere. - Sense temporal disturbances (e.g. use of Time Arcanum, people su\ufb00ering from \u201clost\u201d time etc).<br /> <b>Time \u2022\u2022 (Apprentice)</b><br /> \u2022\u2022 <b>Ruling </b>(no speci\ufb01c examples given in the book)<br /> - Temporal Sympathy: mage can use sympathetic links between objects separated by time.<br /> \u2022\u2022 <b>Shielding</b><br /> - Protect oneself from physical harm with slight Time warps and eddies. ( <i><u>Time dots as bonus to Defense </u></i>)<br /> <b>\u2022\u2022 Unveiling</b><br /> - See the future in general terms (simple answers).<br /> - Postcognition: Perceive an event in the past with clarity. Concentration.<br /> \u2022\u2022 Knowing<br /> - Scry ahead in time to check the result of an ongoing event with a simple outcome (coin toss, dice throw, red wire or green wire etc).<br /> - Scry the outcome of a current personal action, and reroll it if necessary.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}